---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Support — Zomsi" description="Support for Zomsi and the Zomsi website.">
<main class="section"><div class="container legal-copy">
<span class="eyebrow">Zomsi support</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4.8rem);margin-top:18px">How can we help?</h1>
<p class="lead">General questions about Zomsi, this website, or any of our products are welcome here. For help with a specific app, its dedicated support page usually has the fastest answer.</p>
<div class="card"><h3>Contact support</h3><p style="color:var(--muted)">Email us at:</p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:contact@zomsi.co">contact@zomsi.co</a></div>
<h2>App-specific support</h2><p>Each Zomsi app has its own support page with troubleshooting steps and FAQs specific to that app. For example, see <a href="https://rummyscore.zomsi.co/support">Rummy Score Support</a>.</p>
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>What is Zomsi?</h3><p>Zomsi is the product brand of Zomsi Info Tech Private Limited. We build focused mobile and web apps.</p>
<h3>How do I report a problem with the website?</h3><p>Email <a href="mailto:contact@zomsi.co">contact@zomsi.co</a> with a description of the issue and, if possible, the page URL and a screenshot.</p>
<h3>How do I report a problem with an app?</h3><p>Visit that app's support page for what details to include, or email us directly and we'll route it appropriately.</p>
</div></main>
</Layout>
